            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.6.1

- Jobs: type a job in a few words and click Write it up. An account with spare room (Claude on Opus when one has room) reads the repo, without changing anything, and writes a proper issue: what to do, which files, how to tell it's done, how to check. Edit it, then Create job, or Create and run.
- The pace line now counts from a free reset when it sees one, instead of from the start of the week.
]]></description>
